    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        208,
        1860,
        1984,
        1997
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "I feel that by seeing this play we would all learn a great deal about the almost 800,000 Puerto Ricans presently making their homes here in New York City.",
